# 📚 Library Mode – AI and IoT Project

## Project Description
Library Mode is an AI and IoT-based project that detects whether a person is using a mobile phone in a library.

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Google Colab
- YOLOv8
- OpenCV
- MQTT
- ESP32
- Wokwi Simulator

## Working
1. If a person is detected without a phone, the green LED turns ON.
2. If a person is detected with a phone, the red LED and buzzer turn ON.
3. If no person is detected, all outputs turn OFF.

## MQTT Configuration
- Broker: broker.hivemq.com
- Port: 1883
- Topic: sinchana1hm25cr094

## Project Files
- Colab notebook: AI detection and MQTT publishing.
- sketch.ino: ESP32 program.
- libraries.txt: Required Arduino library.

## Conclusion
This project demonstrates how AI and IoT can help monitor mobile phone usage in a library environment.
